1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Client decisions get scattered across conversations, tasks, and staff handoffs.

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:34,000
ClientOps Memory AI turns those fragments into persistent organizational memory.

3
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:58,000
One instruction becomes typed assignment, decision, and commitment memories.

4
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:18,000
A new session retrieves the decision from CockroachDB and cites its evidence.

5
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Titan embeddings and CockroachDB vector search find paraphrased operational context.

6
00:01:38,000 --> 00:02:04,000
New guidance supersedes the old rule without erasing history.

7
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Confidence, sources, timestamps, corrections, and inference labels make memory accountable.

8
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Amazon Bedrock reasons over durable CockroachDB memory so every next action starts with context.
